  m_Name: FeatureDefinition_HalflingTraits
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: CRPG.Actors::CRPG.Actors.FeatureDefinition
  id: feature-halfling-traits
  displayName: Halfling Traits
  description: 'Ability Score Increase: Your Dexterity score increases by 2.


    Lucky: When you roll a 1 on the d20 for an attack roll, ability check, or saving throw, you can reroll the die and must use the new roll.


    Brave: You have advantage on saving throws against being frightened.


    Halfling Nimbleness: You can move through the space of any creature that is of a size larger than yours.'
  modifiers:
  - queryKey: stat-dexterity
    operation: 0
    value: 2
    priority: 0
  - queryKey: Speed
    operation: 0
    value: 25
    priority: 0
